  "problem": "A tank initially holds $450\\,\\text{gal}$ of a sugar-water solution containing $18\\,\\text{lb}$ of sugar.\nFresh water is poured into the tank at a rate of $15\\,\\text{gal/min},$ while the completely mixed sugar solution leaves the tank at a rate of $10\\,\\text{gal/min}.$\nFind an equation for the amount of sugar $Q(t),$ in pounds, in the tank $t$ minutes after the fresh water is first added.",
